{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_013_title", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_013_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_013_1000_p", "source_sha256": "be8d5eb8463e279d7e439d7ebf9a8ec9023cbf14bd3cb47dba83e8dcf246f960", "ja": "杏奈、ここにいたのか。ちょっと話したいことが\nあるんだけど、今いいかな？", "zh": "杏奈，你在这啊。\n我有些事想跟你说，现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_013_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "5afa7b146a437a2c1abca1719ce3d46fac074a4cdd07ea744be2d0afd68e1998", "ja": "…………{$P$}さん……。\nん……いい、よ……どうしたの…………？", "zh": "…………{$P$}先生……\n嗯……可以喔……有什么事吗…………？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_013_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ed287db348c3229d99708f59d30ecb8498c5d1742c26665889057a5e9d2c3931", "ja": "次の劇場定期公演を、そろそろ……と思ってるんだ。\nで、センターは杏奈に任せたいんだが、いいか？", "zh": "差不多该开始准备剧场的定期公演了……\n这次，我想让杏奈来担任Center，你愿意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_013_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "af82e851103f7e39aec8e9a7a8da9eb2d09ef5b18cb3a6fb8eb10a5322066e07", "ja": "え…………杏奈、が……センター……？", "zh": "咦……杏奈……当Center……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_013_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "8c77fc16f99832bb3b70c5cde8f15c80cbf8b81884f62589d58a64f0907530ab", "ja": "わぁ、やったね、杏奈ちゃん！　センターは\n大変なこともあるけど、すっごく楽しいよ！", "zh": "哇，太好了耶，小杏！\n当Center虽然很辛苦，可是超开心的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_013_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "3890f918d7cdf74c16e8d2a3317a7d5630a6de4d7e2f7b460fc1d04f71648b80", "ja": "せやで、杏奈！　この話は受けなあかん！\nさあ、今すぐハンコを押すんや。さあさあさあ！！", "zh": "就是说呀，杏奈！你一定要答应嘿！\n来来，现在马上盖章吧。快点快点！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_013_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ed210eebee27b32fbaf246c9de170744ba8b916ebd3a10555667d7950dc4658b", "ja": "いや、ハンコとかは、いらないから、奈緒……。", "zh": "等等，不需要盖印章啦，奈绪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_013_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d652a920102da4fb761ccb13cfe28b9e7e81d05dbc6173fd795ca9a504b7ea7e", "ja": "まあ、でも、二人の言うように、杏奈にとっては\n良い話というか、良い経験になると思うが、どうだ？", "zh": "不过，确实就像她们所说，这对杏奈来说是件好事，\n或者该说是个很好的经验。你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_013_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "e1aba7ac3ed679a0eaaa28d6d63d235629805631b91e499ed5c872fbb50d2ad8", "ja": "……わかった。……{$P$}さん……\n杏奈、ちょっぴり……不安、だけど……やってみます。", "zh": "……杏奈明白了……{$P$}先生……\n虽然有点不安……不过……杏奈愿意试试看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_013_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "f7dead75241514f1a9949cf337be65c5896856cc08ecc376cc35f30df8a9273a", "ja": "百合子さん……奈緒さんも……ありがと……。\n杏奈……頑張る……ね……。", "zh": "百合子……奈绪……谢谢你们……\n杏奈……会加油的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
